Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我們叫到這裡的委託人還沒出現嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼好急的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是要去參加婚禮還是幹啥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,發給我們這邀請的傢伙到底是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從地球另一端屁顛屁顛的過來,我們被門板夾了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,7，你從生下來不就已經被夾過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說來還不是你個sx拖我過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這y想幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.31,0:01:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亞美爹, 殺人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閉上你的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們就鬧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照邀請函來看,我們的目標是奪得Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自從Shiva1族被混沌軍勢清掃出去以來, 都過了20年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,現在這東西歸混沌軍勢所有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但這真可能嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是要和混沌軍勢開戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌軍勢是親體智慧生命體
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,群體全遵從領導指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像工蜂在女王麾下一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西卡西,王要是掛了, 他們就要在這星球上滅絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中央集權,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們摸上城堡, 把王卡嚓掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很簡單嗎, 小孩都可以, 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是沒有保證我們能活著回來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Galaxy Knights(銀河騎士)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邀請函裡有份計劃的拷貝, 還有一張黑桃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva之前所有者, Shiva王的紋章, 代表著權力與正義
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,換句話說, 就是黑桃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,國王的侍衛大家都知道, 叫做黑桃K
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個表示我們這些無畏的黑桃騎士被選出來奪回城堡, 恢復Shiva王的榮耀.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那, 選中的人有幾個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,13個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這估計是為人寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是6
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是4
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是7   8
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前在我們各自拿到不同的邀請函
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10， 3, 5, 2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是J
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們之間名字就不用了, 就用這個來叫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是Q
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來這計劃洩露了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面有混沌士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人拿著9號
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已經死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐, 你幹的?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別從外表看人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很專業
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殺人方面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空手殺人的99種方法我都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙是混沌兵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是奸細
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌兵是群體智慧生命體
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身體對他們來說只不過是容器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這才是本體
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有2個戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對,這邊還有個哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能知道那Y是混沌兵真不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,憑氣味就能聞出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能聞到他們用來潤滑關節的油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好聞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Parure(香水)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,強力, 感性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還真適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你從什麼時候站那的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剛才
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Q(Queen)是嗎,我們可以出發了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡熱死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是這算約會的話,就免了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,約會, 馬薩卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想請你當我的保鏢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼,外面很危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌軍的機械獸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們被包圍了, 驚人的數量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.97,0:08:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是機械獸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是男人嗎, 戰鬥啊, 靠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你在逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬路野狼, 勇敢的騎士怎麼會怕蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炫耀的另一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快,沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,時間,什麼時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到點了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼會來?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳, 下面什麼都看不見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那在這等死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們已經死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡是天國嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別發傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你在一起當然是地獄了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不, 火車頂罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真準時啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英國地鐵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活下來的就我們4人?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5人啊,別把我和你搞一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才是對不住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就5人,奪得城堡的事沒可能了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一個人也要上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,計劃書寫不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個人數夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那,我可以相信你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們還沒見過你的牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又夢到同一個噩夢了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的過去到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊,你根本不記得任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你身上的紋身也
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是,等著,總有天我能把記憶還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且把你從噩夢中解脫出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼讓你這麼吵鬧,王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是那個哈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在Gizla你算個勇敢的戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你每晚夢裡哭的像個孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是我的搖錢樹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要挖盡你的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王,好好頂住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的任務是好好穩住王的精神狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不行了,我就立馬把你扔到奴隸市場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根據計劃,為了奪取Shiva城堡聚集的人中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第13人應該在這座Gizla城裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那男人是個導遊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來,他是唯一知道如何潛入城堡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要徑直闖入有混沌軍隊看守的城堡是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要進入Shiva城堡, 我們一定需要那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人是何方神聖?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他被叫做王, 好像是個身上有個黑色女人紋身的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是奴隸販子 Zaru的居所.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡是風景區, 早就告訴你們不要再這擺攤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混沌士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個小城在混沌軍的統治之下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不小心被抓到的話, 會被當做奴隸賣掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,我會記住的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了,王被關在地牢裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地牢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奴隸主Zaru的住所下面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是奴隸,當做角鬥士
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我還發現一件有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.32,0:18:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你整容了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是星際懸賞的海賊, Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左手是槍的傢伙, 宇宙裡只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那, 這y是想要我的簽名嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道殺手Bull嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,賞金獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:19:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的摯友, 被你殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的仇我會報的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你對好友還真是愚忠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們的恩怨放到任務之後去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊,我們的目標是Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,y,我們可沒時間玩內訌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,煩死了, Tv人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總是像嬰兒一樣, 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧,這事完成之後
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那時,你做好覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算如何
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,潛入房子很容易,但帶走一個奴隸, 可難了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放出煙花, 混亂中逃出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對表
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9點開始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9點哈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根據奪取Shiva城堡的計劃書,我們所需最後一人在這個叫Gizla的小城裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來潛入城堡的道路只有這Y知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我必須要和這傢伙戰鬥不可
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有我的同伴, 你們這些,  J, Q, 7， 還有這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想就是8吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好幹他一票
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下集Cobra動畫:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第13男
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.31,0:23:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夜露死苦
